{
  "html": "<div class=\"postArticle-content js-postField js-notesSource editable\" id=\"editor_7\" g_editable=\"true\" role=\"textbox\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Title\nTell your story…\"><section name=\"7504\" class=\"section section--body section--first is-withGrafSelection\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><h3 name=\"ca5a\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf--leading graf--title is-selected\" data-testid=\"editorTitleParagraph\">K-Means Clustering for Image Quantization and Segmentation</h3><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"6ae7\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--h3\">Introduction</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"29e0\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">In this blog post, we will delve into the fascinating world of image processing, focusing on two key techniques: image quantization and image segmentation, both of which are implemented using the K-means clustering algorithm. These techniques are integral to various applications in computer vision and image analysis.</p><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"38c5\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">Background</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"d54a\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Clustering is a fundamental concept in data analysis that involves grouping data points into clusters based on similarity. In the context of image processing, clustering is used for tasks like quantization and segmentation.</p><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"fb11\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--p\">Image Quantization</h4><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"91ce\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h4\">Image quantization is the process of reducing the number of distinct colors in an image. This is often done to compress the image, making it easier to store and transmit. For instance, a color image typically has 24-bit color depth, allowing for approximately 16.7 million colors. Quantization can reduce this number to a more manageable figure by clustering similar colors together.</p><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"168e\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--p\">Image Segmentation</h4><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"5e41\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h4\">Image segmentation involves partitioning an image into segments or regions, often to identify and separate objects within the image. This is achieved by clustering pixels based on their color and spatial proximity.</p><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"f522\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">K-Means Clustering</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"0280\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">K-means clustering is a popular unsupervised learning algorithm used for clustering. The goal is to partition the data into <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">k</em> clusters, where each data point belongs to the cluster with the nearest mean. The algorithm iterates through the following steps until convergence:</p><ol class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"6bd7\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--p\">Initialize <em class=\"markup--em markup--li-em\">k </em>centroids randomly.</li><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"4b4d\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Assign each data point to the nearest centroid.</li><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"a08b\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Recalculate the centroids as the mean of the points assigned to each cluster.</li><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"a196\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--li\">Repeat steps 2 and 3 until the centroids stabilize.</li></ol><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"41eb\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--li\">The objective is to minimize the variance within each cluster, defined as:</p><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"92bd\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--p is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 157px; max-height: 47px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 29.9%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"0*i-uBi5nmZwgBTwAA\" data-width=\"157\" data-height=\"47\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/0*i-uBi5nmZwgBTwAA\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"5971\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--figure\">where <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">Ci</em>​ is the <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">i-th</em> cluster and <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">μi</em> is the centroid of <em class=\"markup--em markup--p-em\">Ci​</em>.</p><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"bfe7\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">Implementation in&nbsp;MATLAB</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"35dc\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Let’s look at the MATLAB implementation of these techniques, focusing on the provided assignment and the results obtained.</p><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"0876\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--p\">Quantization</h4><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"5847\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h4\">The quantization function reduces the number of colors in an image using either uniform quantization or the K-means clustering algorithm.</p><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"1188\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">Implementation in&nbsp;MATLAB</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"9e2f\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Let’s look at the MATLAB implementation of these techniques, focusing on the provided assignment and the results obtained.</p><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"43ba\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--p\">Quantization</h4><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"25b4\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h4\">The quantization function reduces the number of colors in an image using either uniform quantization or the K-means clustering algorithm.</p><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorIframeParagraph\" name=\"d320\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--iframe graf-after--p is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 216.571%;\"></div><div class=\"iframeContainer\"><iframe width=\"700\" height=\"250\" src=\"/media/32d307f754b4e86dbcc4f3a446868188?postId=fc1da1a54fa9\" data-media-id=\"32d307f754b4e86dbcc4f3a446868188\" data-thumbnail=\"https://i.embed.ly/1/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.githubassets.com%2Fassets%2Fgist-og-image-54fd7dc0713e.png&amp;key=a19fcc184b9711e1b4764040d3dc5c07\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for embed (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for embed (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"9bde\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--figure\">Segmentation</h4><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"8418\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h4\">The segmentation function clusters the pixels of an image into meaningful regions using K-means clustering.</p><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorIframeParagraph\" name=\"80c2\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--iframe graf-after--p is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 31.143%;\"></div><div class=\"iframeContainer\"><iframe width=\"700\" height=\"250\" src=\"/media/1e4bdad6081a09064cb8cbd09b01532e?postId=fc1da1a54fa9\" data-media-id=\"1e4bdad6081a09064cb8cbd09b01532e\" data-thumbnail=\"https://i.embed.ly/1/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.githubassets.com%2Fassets%2Fgist-og-image-54fd7dc0713e.png&amp;key=a19fcc184b9711e1b4764040d3dc5c07\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for embed (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for embed (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"1569\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--h4-strong\">Main</strong></h4><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorIframeParagraph\" name=\"19f5\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf--iframe graf-after--h4 is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 45.857%;\"></div><div class=\"iframeContainer\"><iframe width=\"700\" height=\"250\" src=\"/media/f08434ad122e7388731930d0c54ad0bf?postId=fc1da1a54fa9\" data-media-id=\"f08434ad122e7388731930d0c54ad0bf\" data-thumbnail=\"https://i.embed.ly/1/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.githubassets.com%2Fassets%2Fgist-og-image-54fd7dc0713e.png&amp;key=a19fcc184b9711e1b4764040d3dc5c07\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for embed (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for embed (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"25ef\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--figure\">Results</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"30e1\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">Let’s examine the results of applying these techniques to various images with different values of kk. Below are some examples:</p><h4 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"eff8\" class=\"graf graf--h4 graf-after--p\">Image:</h4><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"ba6b\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--h4\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 640px; max-height: 400px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 62.5%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*eQQm81Jr4jReAC_9E13mOQ.jpeg\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"400\" data-is-featured=\"true\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*eQQm81Jr4jReAC_9E13mOQ.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\">frutis.jpg</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"6641\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Quantized Image (k=2)</strong>:</li></ul><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"1d9b\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--li is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 700px; max-height: 374px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 53.400000000000006%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*BA-VyfEAlWWSCc2_hQOT5g.jpeg\" data-width=\"1281\" data-height=\"684\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*BA-VyfEAlWWSCc2_hQOT5g.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><ul class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"f55c\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Quantized Image (k=4)</strong>:</li></ul><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"9176\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--li is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 700px; max-height: 374px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 53.400000000000006%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*sHiArlDBU-qX2K6Tn5-k4g.jpeg\" data-width=\"1281\" data-height=\"684\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*sHiArlDBU-qX2K6Tn5-k4g.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><ul class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"7d25\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Quantized Image (k=7)</strong>:</li></ul><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"a172\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--li is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 700px; max-height: 374px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 53.400000000000006%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*OZzrp_k2DEU8-jotmaPpUw.jpeg\" data-width=\"1281\" data-height=\"684\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*OZzrp_k2DEU8-jotmaPpUw.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><ul class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"731f\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Segmented Image (k=2)</strong>:</li></ul><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"203f\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--li is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 700px; max-height: 374px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 53.400000000000006%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*N7LoJfUvuAXFjVv_EyBQDw.jpeg\" data-width=\"1281\" data-height=\"684\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*N7LoJfUvuAXFjVv_EyBQDw.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><ul class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"28ce\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Segmented Image (k=4)</strong>:</li></ul><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"ea60\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--li is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 700px; max-height: 374px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 53.400000000000006%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*wi6EflwdPIGtmcLiJmSeog.jpeg\" data-width=\"1281\" data-height=\"684\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*wi6EflwdPIGtmcLiJmSeog.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><ul class=\"postList\"><li data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"6198\" class=\"graf graf--li graf-after--figure\"><strong class=\"markup--strong markup--li-strong\">Segmented Image (k=7)</strong>:</li></ul><figure tabindex=\"0\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-testid=\"editorImageParagraph\" name=\"9f3c\" class=\"graf graf--figure graf-after--li is-defaultValue\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder is-locked\" style=\"max-width: 700px; max-height: 374px;\"><div class=\"aspectRatioPlaceholder-fill\" style=\"padding-bottom: 53.400000000000006%;\"></div><img class=\"graf-image\" data-image-id=\"1*TAUNxxRiBgr-Bba4cdfR0Q.jpeg\" data-width=\"1281\" data-height=\"684\" src=\"https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1600/1*TAUNxxRiBgr-Bba4cdfR0Q.jpeg\"><div class=\"crosshair u-ignoreBlock\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-default-value=\"Type caption for image (optional)\"><span class=\"defaultValue\">Type caption for image (optional)</span><br></figcaption></figure><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"6387\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--figure\">Discussion</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"c085\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">As the value of kk increases, the quantized image becomes more similar to the original image, as it captures more color information. Similarly, higher kk values in segmentation result in more detailed and fine-grained regions, allowing better differentiation between objects and backgrounds.</p><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"1c53\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">Conclusion</h3><p data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\" name=\"7b65\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3\">This blog post presented an overview of image quantization and segmentation using K-means clustering. We covered the theoretical background, provided MATLAB implementations, and discussed the results. While this project was based on a university assignment from several years ago, the principles and techniques remain relevant and are widely used in modern image processing tasks.</p><h3 data-testid=\"editorHeadingText\" name=\"9059\" class=\"graf graf--h3 graf-after--p\">Final Note</h3><p name=\"846e\" class=\"graf graf--p graf-after--h3 graf--trailing\" data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\">This blog post is based on an academic project from my university years. The content and implementations may be slightly outdated, and readers are encouraged to verify and update the methods as needed. For further details, you can access the complete source code on <a href=\"https://medium.com/r/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhamuryen%2FImageProcessing%2Ftree%2Fmain%2Fquantizatio_and_segmentation\" data-href=\"https://medium.com/r/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhamuryen%2FImageProcessing%2Ftree%2Fmain%2Fquantizatio_and_segmentation\" class=\"markup--anchor markup--p-anchor\" rel=\"noopener\" data-tooltip=\"https://medium.com/r/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhamuryen%2FImageProcessing%2Ftree%2Fmain%2Fquantizatio_and_segmentation\" data-tooltip-position=\"bottom\" data-tooltip-type=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>.</p></div></div></section><section name=\"a874\" class=\"section section--body section--last\"><div class=\"section-divider\"><hr class=\"section-divider\"></div><div class=\"section-content\"><div class=\"section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn\"><p name=\"ebc3\" class=\"graf graf--p graf--leading graf--trailing\" data-testid=\"editorParagraphText\">I hope this post provides valuable insights into the applications of K-means clustering in image processing.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"u-sm-hide u-absolute u-marginRight30 u-textColorNormal u-fontSize14 u-textAlignRight\" style=\"top: 23px; right: 1206.5px; height: 121px;\"><div class=\"u-absolute u-left14 u-top0 u-width1 u-height100pct u-overflowHidden\"><div class=\"js-labelBar u-borderRightLighter u-transition--transform125 u-height100pct u-absolute u-topNegative100Percent\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 121px, 0px);\"></div></